### 32. Дубликат email → 409 Conflict, запись не создаётся
POST http://127.0.0.1:8080/api/users
Authorization: Basic YWRtaW5AdG91cm5hbWVudC5jb206cGFzczEyMw==
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "coach@test.com",
  "password": "pass123",
  "firstName": "Другой",
  "lastName": "Человек",
  "role": "COACH"
}

###
### 33. Неполные данные пользователя → 400
POST http://127.0.0.1:8080/api/users
Authorization: Basic YWRtaW5AdG91cm5hbWVudC5jb206cGFzczEyMw==
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "firstName": "Без Email"
}

###
### 34. Короткий пароль → 400
POST http://127.0.0.1:8080/api/users
Authorization: Basic YWRtaW5AdG91cm5hbWVudC5jb206cGFzczEyMw==
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "short@test.com",
  "password": "123",
  "firstName": "Короткий",
  "lastName": "Пароль",
  "role": "PLAYER"
}

###
### 35. Команда сама с собой → 422 BusinessRuleException
POST http://127.0.0.1:8080/api/matches
Authorization: Basic bWFuYWdlckB0b3VybmFtZW50LmNvbTpwYXNzMTIz
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "homeTeamId": 1,
  "awayTeamId": 1
}

###
### 36. Тренер в роли судьи турнира → 403 AccessDeniedException
POST http://127.0.0.1:8080/api/tournaments
Authorization: Basic bWFuYWdlckB0b3VybmFtZW50LmNvbTpwYXNzMTIz
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Неправильный Кубок",
  "sportType": "FOOTBALL",
  "refereeId": 1
}

###
### 37. Несуществующая команда → 404 NotFoundException
POST http://127.0.0.1:8080/api/matches
Authorization: Basic bWFuYWdlckB0b3VybmFtZW50LmNvbTpwYXNzMTIz
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "homeTeamId": 999,
  "awayTeamId": 2
}

